{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_10_level_main_10-05_end",
  "groupId": "main_10",
  "stageId": "main_10-05",
  "title": "雖非同族",
  "storyCode": "10-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_10-05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c45e1f6cce96e59603222ad9a2e9ff3d43d7b4b6aeae72351e43998fe9de633d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "3:22 P.M. 天氣/陰\n倫蒂尼姆，薩迪恩區，地下結構"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我不覺得這是個明智的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "洛洛，我們人手不夠。上面我們還沒查過的能藏人的地方還有多少？至少占薩迪恩區的三分之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道的，哈默哥他們已經在準備轉移工作，等過了這兩天，指揮官他們就會離開這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到時候，就算我們小隊留下搜尋，成功機率也會小得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這並不能構成你想讓那些人加入我們的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是加入......是互相幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不是聽到指揮官的話了嗎？他們是朋友的朋友。我們答應了那位朋友的請求，幫他們進入倫蒂尼姆，而他們已經來到這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#8$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下來，要是他們能幫我們找人的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他們可以在我們的據點休整。這是指揮官的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等他們休息好了，他們就會離開這裡。我會護送他們到地面上安全的地方，可也到此為止了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#6$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼不能問問他們願不願意暫時留下？只是一個小忙而已，他們未必會拒絕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#7$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道為什麼，我說過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "指揮官認為他們值得信任，這一定是有理由的。所以我不會再質疑他們的身份和動機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，我不想讓我們的人攪和進無關的危險裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你覺得他們要做的事很危險？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你以為他們是來幹什麼的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "帶著一隊身懷絕技的薩卡茲潛入倫蒂尼姆，把另一撥薩卡茲當作敵人......費斯特，我們是維多利亞人，應當見慣了這種事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你是說那些天天在倫蒂尼姆外面打架的貴族老爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "自我們出生起，他們就打得沒完沒了，不是嗎？要不是他們只顧著自己打架，我們的家也不會成了薩卡茲的別院。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#1$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們光是要把自己的家搶回來，就已經夠累了......薩卡茲們想在我們的土地上打起來，我們根本無力阻止，更何況這與我們也無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......萬一他們真的能阻止城內的薩卡茲呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許你覺得他們只是為了搶另一頂王冠，但至少目前看來，我們有著共同的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "費斯特，我沒你那麼自信，總以為我們能掌控局面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "薩卡茲......薩卡茲根本就不是你想的那樣，他們很會偽裝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "爸爸被處死的那天，我遠遠地看見了一個人......那些劊子手叫她殿下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在那個時候，我才知道，原來統率群魔的王，竟然是那副模樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......你從來沒有跟我說起過這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#9$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因為那時候我以為沒這個必要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在我要告訴你......我希望你知道，我們不能被表象蒙蔽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#10$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使那位薩卡茲女性有著純白無瑕的外貌，即使她會為一個無關緊要的倫蒂尼姆老工人露出那般悲傷的神情，我都不會忘記......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#3$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是她帶領著那些薩卡茲殺死了我爸爸，也殺死了無數維多利亞人......她是魔王！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃......阿米婭小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "費斯特先生，洛洛小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "洛洛",
      "speakerToken": "avg_4040_rockr_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我說完了，隊長。我回地面繼續我們的搜查任務，你......請你考慮一下我的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費斯特",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_402_1#4$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿米婭小姐，博士，抱歉......那個，我要幫哈默哥調整裝備......我也先離開一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士，洛洛小姐說的那位薩卡茲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "還沒有足夠的資訊。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "聽起來不是很像特雷西斯。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那是一位......有著悲憫神情的白髮女性。其他薩卡茲叫她殿下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，雖然你忘記了，但是我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我忘不了她的每一個最細微的表情，還有她對我說的每一句話。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你的意思是......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "怎麼可能！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我很清楚，這不可能。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但是，我......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，從今天開始，你將擁有調取以下檔案的權限。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "你會在這些檔案裡找到一部分你關心的資訊——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "無論是關於她，還是關於阿米婭目前所繼承的那部分力量。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我記得你說過，你不信我。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "在這個時間點上，談論信任與否已經沒有意義。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我無法否認你對阿米婭而言的重要性。此次倫蒂尼姆行動，她最需要的就是你的幫助。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "博士......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "無論你們在倫蒂尼姆看見什麼，請和阿米婭一起面對。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凱爾希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我知道你能做到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭，別著急。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是啊......我不應該著急。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我差一點就想去追洛洛小姐，問清楚她看見的到底是誰。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這樣的話......可能會加深她對我們的誤解。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭也可以有自己的情緒。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "阿米婭對自己已經很嚴格了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯......博士，我好些了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在來倫蒂尼姆之前，你應該已經從凱爾希醫生口中瞭解到了一些過去的事......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但有些話，我還沒有機會說。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "其實，在那件事之後，有很長一段時間，我都會夢見你們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "在我的夢裡，你從來沒有開過口，你只是安靜地守著我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "就像過去那些荒地上的夜晚一樣，你沉默地握著我的手，因為只有這樣，我才能放心睡著。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我能感覺到你......那時候，我知道你只是睡著了，Dr.{@nickname}，你也許暫時不在我的身邊，但你依然陪伴著我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米婭......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可是她......不一樣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她在夢裡對我說了很多話，從羅德島上每一個薩卡茲的命運，到我那一天是不是睡不好，有沒有著涼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她叮囑了我許多事，就彷彿她還在我身邊似的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "越是這樣......越是這樣，我就越清楚地感覺到，她已經離開我們了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "相信你的感覺。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你是最清楚的人。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她很不捨......非常非常不捨。她心裡記掛的人和事本來就有那麼多。我們，凱爾希醫生，羅德島，薩卡茲......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果......她真的還在，她怎麼可能不回來？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你們口中的那個人，不會做這種事。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#15$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "是的，她絕不可能拋下我們不管。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#17$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "而且她不會縱容特雷西斯入侵維多利亞......她無法忍受薩卡茲挑起這樣一場不義的戰爭。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "肯定只是一場誤會。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#5$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "博士的意思是，洛洛小姐看到的是另一位與她相似的薩卡茲？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#5$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "的確有這個可能性。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "會不會是特雷西斯做了什麼？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "這種手段......非常殘忍。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "薩卡茲比任何種族都要重視死亡。死去的薩卡茲的精魂會回歸整個族群，這是對薩卡茲一生苦難的最好慰藉。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "博士，你也見證了愛國者先生的逝去。那關乎尊嚴、榮譽，和一個人一生最後一次對自身命運的詰問。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "而死亡的寧靜會給出一個答案，這個答案將包容他的一切。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米婭",
              "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "任何薩卡茲都不該被剝奪這最後的平靜......尤其是她，她已然為薩卡茲奉獻了全部。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，你還記不記得我在出入口岸說的話？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我知道盤踞在倫蒂尼姆中心的情感是什麼了。那是憤怒，薩卡茲的憤怒。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#11$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不光我能聽見，這憤怒已經強烈到了每一個薩卡茲都能聽到的地步。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "即使是溫迪戈的祭壇也無法起到這麼強烈的共鳴效果。就好像，有人把薩卡茲燒了成千上萬年的怨恨凝聚成了一團實體的火焰......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果沒人阻止的話，它早晚會焚穿倫蒂尼姆的天幕，然後蔓延開去，燒盡萬千生靈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "所以，我們需要儘早靠近它，確認引燃一切的焰心是什麼。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我擔心你，阿米婭。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "靠近它，你會不會受傷？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，你看出來了。是的，我的心態......和以前不完全一樣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "急著奔向那團火焰的人並不是羅德島的負責人，可能也不是他們口中的繼承人......而是阿米婭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這是我的渴望，是我這個個體想要的答案。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而且......我確實有一點害怕。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，我害怕那個答案，我不想看到凱爾希醫生和大家心碎......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "還有你自己，阿米婭。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯，是的，還有我自己。假如那真的是她......我不願意想像......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#2$1",
