        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我和你一起面對。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我們一起把路走出來。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "謝謝你，博士......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "僅僅只是感覺到你在身邊，我就有了走下去的勇氣。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我這就去找克洛維希婭指揮官，提出合作方案。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他們需要更多人手來救出被薩卡茲關押的戰友。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我們也需要他們的幫助。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "按照原定計劃，我們本該已經見到我們的接應人，也就是那位信使女士。我們必須確認她的安危。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "她是自救軍的朋友，或許指揮官能幫我們找到她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "而且，接下來進入中央城區的路途，如果能有他們指引，肯定也會更加順利。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_394_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "羅德島會向倫蒂尼姆市民自救軍證明，我們絕不是為了薩卡茲的王冠而來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅本",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "號角，深池士兵的動向非常奇怪！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......他們正在往某一個方向轉移。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅本",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那塊區域不是被薩卡茲重兵把守著嗎？以前深池都不敢靠近那裡的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他們一定有理由。我最好跟上去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅本",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這會不會有點冒險......他們的人數是我們的十倍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "所以我一個人去。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你們繼續按原定計劃，去他們的據點找東西。他們才剛開始移動，物資應該還沒來得及帶走。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......注意安全。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "羅本",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_413_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你也是！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "喂，抓緊了。長官一秒都不想耽擱！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我知道你不情願。誰情願做這個？那幫魔族佬，竟敢把我們當雇傭兵一樣差遣！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但別讓我看見你偷懶。在薩卡茲面前，我們誰都別丟長官的臉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你怎麼還不跟上來？M-611，回話！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "怎、怎麼回事？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
