          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "別動。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "是......是你！M-601，呼叫......呃啊！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......也別出聲。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唔呃......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "通訊器拿過來。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嗯，你可以說話了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "咳、咳咳......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "告訴我，你們要替薩卡茲做什麼？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我......我怎麼可能跟你說這些......維多利亞的惡狼......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "讓我想想，深池是怎麼對付那些不願意開口的維多利亞士兵的？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......吊在十幾米高的滑輪裝置上，對吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "可惜，我不會什麼變出石柱的源石技藝，做不到輕輕鬆鬆地把人送到那麼高的地方。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你......你不會用這種手段......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不會嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "也對，要是我像你們的長官那樣無恥，我也不至於會眼睜睜看著自己的隊員一個個地犧牲在小丘郡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那這樣吧。我綁起你的手腳，然後把你丟到隨便哪個廢棄工廠裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這樣的工廠在附近有很多，一個個去找的話，大概也花不了多少時間。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "這才是我的做法，沒錯吧？我就是靠這樣的耐心，從你們手裡找到了一些可憐的士兵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但願你在黑暗中絕望地餓死之前，你的長官也能找到你......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不......不！長官她不會......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "深池士兵",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_406_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "饒了我吧，你想知道什麼？我只是聽命行事，很多事情我也不明白......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我想也是。那名薩卡茲的指揮官可比你的指揮官聰明多了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "他心裡到底有什麼計劃，蔓德拉不可能猜得到。你們只能這樣被薩卡茲們耍得團團轉......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "號角",
          "speakerToken": "avg_4039_horn_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "行吧，你只需要告訴我你們的目的地。剩下的事情，我自己去弄清楚。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "既然回來了，你還不如早些來見我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "誰叫你的客人這麼多嘛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#3$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我忘了，你不想見赦罪師的信使。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "萬一讓他發現我在你這裡，那我偷懶的日子豈不是到頭了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那你也不必等到赫德雷走了以後才現身。他是我的人，不會對王庭透露你的行蹤。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唉，你的人？你別騙自己了，你壓根誰都不信。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "要是你真信他，你直接喊我出來不行嗎？是你等到那個深池的菲林和你的雇傭兵朋友都走了以後，才和我打招呼的啊。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "先不說這些。今天早上，你幫我把深池的人引到了約好的位置，我會記得這份人情。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啊......這只是一件小事。而且，我還有一些意外的收獲哦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......意外收獲？能讓你這麼說，肯定不是發現了區區幾個反抗軍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那麼......你在下面還見到了羅德島的人？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不止哦。不是我見到了他們，而是他們把我從深池士兵的手裡“救”了下來，我們一起到了城牆外。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "唉，要不是你急著試驗你這些寶貝武器，害得我不得不被“炸死”在他們面前，說不定我還能繼續跟著他們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "畢竟，我還想和她再好好聊一聊的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果我說，還有機會呢？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "又要請我幫忙？你不是讓深池和雇傭兵一起去守臨時監獄了嗎？我以為你都做足了準備，只差請君入甕了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我從不會嫌保險太多。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "好吧好吧，那你又欠我們一份人情了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "啊......我是不是說了“我們”？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......沒關係，除了我，不會有人聽見。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "說實話，我們真不太想再留在這裡......那個自戀的到哪都要端著高腳杯的老傢伙也快到了，不是嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你也千萬別告訴他我們在這裡。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#7$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......我知道。我會記住閣下的好意。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_404_1#8$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "還有......閣下最好不要再頂著死者的面貌繼續行動了。即便不說容易暴露的問題，這也讓我......有些不適。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "嘖，我們都忘了，你可真是個有道德的好薩卡茲，對吧，特雷西斯的學徒？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "倫蒂尼姆市民？",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_416_1#1$1",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "放心吧，下次來見你的，絕對不會再是“托馬斯先生”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
